###### 1st *Method* of Function Antiderivative $F_x(t)$ with *Continuous* Function Parameter $f_x(t)$

$F_x(τ) = x(τ) = x(0) + \int_0^τ f_v(τ') dτ' \approx c + Δτ \sum_{i=1}^τ f_v(τ_i)\;;\; τ_i \le τ$

